---
import { evidence } from '../content/portfolio';
---

<section class="section evidence" id="evidence" aria-labelledby="evidence-title">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-heading evidence-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">QA Evidence Preview</p>
        <h2 id="evidence-title">프로젝트 바깥의 QA 기본기</h2>
      </div>
      <p>문제를 발견한 시점과 QA 판단, 수정 뒤 다시 확인한 범위를 대표 사례로 보여줍니다.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="evidence-grid">
      {evidence.map((item) => (
        <article class="evidence-card">
          <span class="evidence-number">EVIDENCE {item.number}</span>
          <h3>{item.title}</h3>
          <p>{item.message}</p>
          <ul class="keyword-list" role="list">
            {item.keywords.map((keyword) => <li>{keyword}</li>)}
          </ul>
          {item.href ? (
            <a class="text-link" href={item.href}>{item.cta}</a>
          ) : (
            <span class="evidence-status">{item.cta}</span>
          )}
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
